<article  data-history-node-id="239" class="node node--type-page node--view-mode-full">
  <div  class="node__content">
              <div class="page__body" id="page__body">
        
      <div class="field field--name-field-body-paras field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="gen3col paragraph">

    
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__items">
          

      <div class="field field--name-field-gen3col-items field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden column3col field__items">
              <div class="field__item column3col__col">


  <div class="gen3col__item clearfix paragraph">

          
              <h3 class="gen3col__title">
                      <a href="/about-qcc/administration/human-resources">
              Human Resources
            </a>
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__body">
          <p>The Human Resources Team is committed to providing professional and exceptional customer service to the employees and prospective employees of Quinsigamond Community College within a supportive work environment, while striving to ensure a spirit of collegiality, civility, trust, and integrity within the college community.</p>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item column3col__col">


  <div class="gen3col__item clearfix paragraph">

          
              <h3 class="gen3col__title">
                      <a href="/about-qcc/administration/distance-learning-and-center-academic-excellence">
              Distance Learning &amp; Center for Academic Excellence
            </a>
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__body">
          <p>The Office of Distance Learning &amp; Center for Academic Excellence provides activities that support academic excellence and classroom innovation for faculty, as well as training and activities designed to enhance the teaching and learning environment.</p>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item column3col__col">


  <div class="gen3col__item clearfix paragraph">

          
              <h3 class="gen3col__title">
                      <a href="/professional-development">
              Professional Development
            </a>
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__body">
          <p>Academic Affairs Professional Development and Staff Development are important in making sure faculty and staff are engaged and enriched in their professional careers through trainings and activities.</p>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
          </div>
  
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="gen3col paragraph">

    
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__items">
          

      <div class="field field--name-field-gen3col-items field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden column3col field__items">
              <div class="field__item column3col__col">


  <div class="gen3col__item clearfix paragraph">

          
              <h3 class="gen3col__title">
                      <a href="/about-qcc/administration/media-services">
              Media Services
            </a>
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__body">
          Media Services strives to bring the best audio and visual technology available to the staff, faculty, and professors at the College.
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item column3col__col">


  <div class="gen3col__item clearfix paragraph">

          
              <h3 class="gen3col__title">
                      <a href="/support/it-service-desk">
              Help Desk FAQs
            </a>
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__body">
          <p>Need help with technology? Check out our frequently asked questions or contact the Information Technology Service Desk.</p>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item column3col__col">


  <div class="gen3col__item clearfix paragraph">

          
              <h3 class="gen3col__title">
                      <a href="/support/specialized-support/student-accessibility-services/digital-and-web-accessibility">
              Digital and Web Accessibility
            </a>
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen3col__body">
          <p>At Quinsigamond Community College, we believe that education and resources should be accessible to everyone. Digital accessibility means designing our websites, mobile apps, and online course materials so that all individuals, including those with disabilities, can easily navigate, understand, and interact with our digital spaces independently.</p>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
          </div>
  
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="events3col paragraph">
                                                                                          </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="news3col paragraph">

                                                                                        <div class="news3col__header-intro">
            <div class="news3col__header-wrapper">
